  (text "SIMPLE IN-LINE DRIVE.  The box sits in the 4-core cable and owns the winding permanently." (at 54.61 472.44 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "1fc1a7b0-f5d6-5eb2-99fc-0c9709d2da69")
  )
  (text "Reverting is physical:   motor - box - handset   becomes   motor - handset." (at 54.61 476.25 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "dccf4d1f-8bb2-51ad-b1c9-1c28fe279a2f")
  )
  (text "The handset is no longer in the motor circuit.  It is fed 3V3 and its rockers are read as" (at 54.61 483.87 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "8bbc0a7e-5c08-553f-bdd3-99b3b763c5a4")
  )
  (text "dry contacts - high at rest through the OEM NC contact, low when pressed.  Because 29V can" (at 54.61 487.68 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "4d7acb1c-801f-5726-82ea-fa99a6a30bd3")
  )
  (text "never appear on those conductors, no clamp diodes are needed." (at 54.61 491.49 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "9abce7e1-2b23-5027-8e14-b660914c1b0a")
  )
  (text "POLARITY (measured on the 4-pin Mini-Fit Jr, circuits numbered on the housing):" (at 54.61 500.38 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "9c4c52ad-45cf-5876-94a1-257a03b77d60")
  )
  (text "    circuit 1 = motor      circuit 3 = supply +" (at 54.61 504.19 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "d1dead86-ff09-5279-873d-495b15d8d6b7")
  )
  (text "    circuit 2 = motor      circuit 4 = supply -" (at 54.61 508.00 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "45136835-a971-5700-a50e-53adf9b54f9d")
  )
  (text "    circuit 2 positive, circuit 1 negative  =  UP.   Reverse = DOWN." (at 54.61 511.81 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "5268dd62-486f-57f5-8041-4f920a0aed7f")
  )
  (text "MOT_A is defined as the conductor that must be POSITIVE to raise the desk" (at 54.61 515.62 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "ae1cdeae-e8ed-5d21-9a5b-434c88550e84")
  )
  (text "(circuit 2).  MOT_B is circuit 1." (at 54.61 519.43 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "445f4567-cf96-5a50-a5e7-680e6a4c95fc")
  )
  (text "K1 / K2 reproduce the OEM rest behaviour:" (at 54.61 528.32 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "865cc54e-02dd-50d8-999f-f30dfbb77e02")
  )
  (text "    both off  ->  both winding ends on VSW  =  BRAKE" (at 54.61 532.13 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "a5e4b324-4cc8-5523-9d6f-e8030ea52651")
  )
  (text "    K1 on -> MOT_B to return, MOT_A stays positive  =  UP" (at 54.61 535.94 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "fe9c498a-fb26-5b13-8873-1172f31ff4f0")
  )
  (text "    K2 on -> MOT_A to return, MOT_B stays positive  =  DOWN" (at 54.61 539.75 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "098d4478-d8e4-5abf-9da1-e84c7470ab58")
  )
  (text "No combination of relay states can short the supply; there is no shoot-through failure mode." (at 54.61 543.56 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "6e3d11a0-8074-51ab-bd4d-7c5dff8a0d06")
  )
  (text "SEQUENCING: relays change state only with Q1 off and current decayed (~50ms).  On a watchdog" (at 54.61 552.45 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "0cfc3ff5-eb1f-5c0b-b4e3-f998155a596b")
  )
  (text "trip Q1 turns off in microseconds while the relays take milliseconds to release, so the" (at 54.61 556.26 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "71a4b388-38ca-56c1-87e6-819cb1d9697a")
  )
  (text "contacts are cold-switched even in a fault.  Loss of drive is coast, which is safe because" (at 54.61 560.07 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "77914af8-5a7a-5c47-a50e-8be404f9ef67")
  )
  (text "the spindle is self-locking and holds the load unpowered." (at 54.61 563.88 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "1c8c148a-4be2-5743-b093-c1baa98a306d")
  )
  (text "U5 sits in the motor leg so it reads current during freewheel as well as during the PWM" (at 54.61 571.50 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "767c7074-99c0-5f15-badd-a9ba4b516102")
  )
  (text "on-time, which a low-side shunt would not.  ISENSE must be on ADC1 (ADC2 dies with WiFi)." (at 54.61 576.58 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "94f3dd2e-0403-5390-b5d0-dee9be04491c")
  )
  (text "R1 / R2 / R6 must sit on non-strapping GPIOs." (at 54.61 580.39 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "b2d0e00c-97d9-5793-a3aa-d303720aacb3")
  )
  (sheet_instances
    (path "/" (page "1"))
